              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 980,
              "content": "v1.1 was already sound in its DNA — a near-monochrome slate palette, a single blue accent, and disciplined governance that reads as mature and executive. The review confirmed the identity and refined within it. v2.0 makes three high-leverage moves: it removes a governance defect (a stray second brand hidden in the tokens), it raises typography to publication grade for long-form reading, and it rebuilds case-study discovery and the resume so impact and scale land first. v1.1 is preserved intact for comparison; every v2 layer was verified against the original.",
